flowchart LR
  A[Photo] --> B[Compress + EXIF strip + sha256]
  B -->|offline| Q[(Outbox)]
  Q -->|online| C
  B --> C[POST /v1/scans]
  C --> D[Signed PUT to Storage]
  D --> E[POST analyze]
  E --> F[Validate image]
  F --> G[ONNX inference]
  G --> H{calibrated<br/>confidence ≥ τ ?}
  H -- no --> I[needs_review<br/>agronomist queue]
  H -- yes --> J[Retrieve KB chunks]
  J --> K{score ≥ min?}
  K -- no --> I
  K -- yes --> L[LLM advice from chunks]
  L --> M{cited + no banned<br/>ingredient?}
  M -- no --> I
  M -- yes --> N[Persist diagnosis + advice + audit]
  N --> O[Outbreak clustering]
  O --> P[Alert draft]
  P --> R[Agronomist approves]
  R --> S[n8n fan-out]
  I --> T[Expert label]
  T --> U[(feedback_labels)]
  U --> V[Next training set]
